WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.167
Your stylist has sent you
a private gown lookbook.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:05.500
Here’s how to make
your first virtual try-on.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:08.448
Open the link in your stylist’s message.

00:00:08.448 --> 00:00:10.460
Tap a gown you want to see on yourself.

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:14.727
For a clear preview, ask someone
to take a full-length photo.

00:00:14.727 --> 00:00:17.727
Stand alone in even
light, face the camera,

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:20.026
and keep your arms a little
away from your waist.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.420
Include your head and both feet.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.361
Check that nothing covers your outline.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.923
Tap Choose photo and pick
that picture from your phone.

00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:29.423
Check the filename.

00:00:29.423 --> 00:00:31.361
You can change it before you continue.

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:35.268
Enter the email address where you
want your stylist to reach you.

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.478
Read the permission statement.

00:00:37.478 --> 00:00:41.340
If you agree to use your photo for
this try-on, select the checkbox.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.082
Tap See it on you.

00:00:43.082 --> 00:00:45.824
Leave the page open while
your preview is being prepared.

00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:47.822
Here’s the finished look.

00:00:47.822 --> 00:00:51.302
Use it to decide which styles
you want to try in the boutique.

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:54.761
Your stylist can check the fit
and fabric with you in person.
